      "value": "I've been having alot of issues with Vive lately, where my headset stops tracking, and to fix, i have to unplug and replug.  If I do that while VRC is running, it has a chance to cut my audio off, and no longer can hear, while in game unless I restart.  Having the ability to change output audio would help make this nuisance bareable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
