      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i totally support this and would add\nsimply a menu with device selector\nsomething along those lines\n\nInput : (Drop Down Menu)\n-Default Device\n-Default Communication Device\n-\"device 0\" (Vive Microphone)\n-\"Microphone\" (High Definition Device)\n\nOutput : (drop down menu)\n-Default Device\n-Default Communication Device\n-\"device 0\" (Vive Headphones)\n-\"Speaker\" (High Definition Device)\n\nFPSVR and Steam VR does it brilliantly but vrchat needs to be restarted each time you want to swap device which is kind of time consuming when you need to setup twice a FBT",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
