      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I totally support this. I find it quite annoying when headset decides to cut out for a second (wireless adapter)  then the game switches my audio without any way to switch it to my headset forcing me and I assume many others to have to totally reset their games in order to fix it. This would help take out a little bit of that extra bit of frustration of ones headset cutting out in vrchat without having to worry about being forced to reset their game if they wish to hear once again.",
