      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We didn't need this for AICom before, but with the upgrade to 2022, windows mixer no longer can differentiate between which process it's applying the override to.\n\nThis means that, we no longer can differentiate the player's game audio from the bots audio.\n\nSo we need this to be able to separate outputs from the users client and the AI Chat Bots client.",
